abstract: >-
  Reproducible Python and Google Colab implementation of nearest-neighbor,
  bilinear, patch-based Gaussian-process, convolutional-neural-network,
  generalized-Wishart-process, and canonical-decomposition-process methods for
  spatial-resolution enhancement of diffusion MRI and tensor fields.
keywords:
  - diffusion MRI
  - super-resolution
  - Gaussian processes
  - generalized Wishart process
  - canonical decomposition process
  - diffusion tensors
  - Google Colab

